WEBVTT

00:00:00.109 --> 00:00:05.770
Create classes and sections

00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:08.809
Open Management, then Classes.

00:00:13.134 --> 00:00:20.842
Switch to Master, press Class, choose the grade level, confirm the name, and save without sections.

00:00:27.951 --> 00:00:34.265
Repeat once for each grade. These master classes are shared across academic years.

00:00:34.731 --> 00:00:40.090
Now switch to Session Classes for the active year and create sections such as A and B.

00:00:51.444 --> 00:00:56.730
Classes are ready
